               END-IF.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       RECONCILE-BEDROOMS-0068.
               EXEC CICS ASKTIME ABSTIME(ABS-TIME)
               END-EXEC.
               EXEC CICS FORMATTIME ABSTIME(ABS-TIME)
                         MMDDYYYY(DATE1)
                         TIME(TIME1)
               END-EXEC.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       NORMALISE-CC-RATING-0069.
               EXEC CICS ASKTIME ABSTIME(ABS-TIME)
               END-EXEC.
               EXEC CICS FORMATTIME ABSTIME(ABS-TIME)
                         MMDDYYYY(DATE1)
                         TIME(TIME1)
               END-EXEC.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       REFRESH-MANAGED-FUND-0070.
               MOVE SPACES TO WS-KEY-CHAR.
